## Source feature-family inventory to complete

This is a map for P124, not an assertion that every listed feature is exercised by an existing automated case. Names come from current native/app.rs and related registrations. Add exact source/selector/cost ownership in the manifest. Optional external hardware/network paths are represented with private prepared sources or marked unobserved; this does not expand physical/provider acceptance beyond the existing scope.

| Shared family | Features/registrations to reconcile | Workflows and directly experienced costs |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Text, icons and controls | Sand, SandText, editable text/input, icons, themes, tokens, sliders, dropdowns, tooltips/toasts, menus | W01/W07/W08/W12/W13; input, resolver reads, text, layout and complete pixels. Shared changed-only password presentation across six native/mobile families is implemented (PASSWORD-MASK-VERIFY); existing Unicode limits, secret accessibility and copy/cut restrictions remain. |
| Stored Message attachment loading | store/message_content; nucleus/message/restoration; engine attachment/private-message/receipt callers | W02/W14/W15/W18/W26; ordered selected-chunk reads and immutable decoded-evidence reuse are implemented. Admitted part slots enforce bounds before I/O, verify exact loaded length/digest and retain proof only until canonical final validation consumes the owner. MESSAGE-CHUNK-READ-VERIFY/MESSAGE-RESTORATION-VERIFY cover numeric missing/error order, integrity-before-metadata precedence, dropped/failed slots, overflow, authority/authenticated-content gates and full SQLite/driver/decoded-buffer memory/CPU. Returned mutable parts retain no trusted evidence; caller-specific protocol/artifact checks remain. |
| Record Link ordering and graph output ownership | protein/record_order; nucleus/graph | W02–W05/W14/W18/W26; one graph walker emits positions or required owned strings directly. Live Record Link ordering borrows UIDs, retains last-row/first-topological-emission duplicate semantics and permutes payloads in place, using a duplicate-only completion mask before truncation. RECORD-LINK-ORDER-VERIFY covers FIFO/successor order, parallel/self edges, cycles, missing endpoints, mixed directions/keys, original source reads and full graph/index/mask/allocation costs. |
| Room compositing and lit overlays | native/topology/appearance/room_order; appearance/overlay | W01/W06/W09/W10/W12/W17/W20/W21/W27; current borrowed room identities, shared compact extraction ordinals, consumed-cloud selection, touched-only per-view nearest distances and empty lit-image extraction are implemented. Preserve room/root/workspace scope, last-wins scene duplicates, current/previous bias precedence, exact finite/max/bias math, text above overlays/clouds, image markers and asset cleanup. ROOM-COMPOSITING-VERIFY/LIT-OVERLAY-PREPARATION-VERIFY charge interner setup, retained maps/slots and cold/tiny/changing/sparse-view total costs. |
| Appearance presentation, lights, textures and rounded geometry | native/topology/appearance; appearance/preparation, lighting, textures, shapes | W01/W06/W09/W10/W12/W17/W20/W21/W27; fresh source admission with reused query/scratch, actual-light selection, idle texture-service no-op, direct triangle indices and changed-only publication are implemented. Preserve 64 materials/8 lights/2 shadow lights/16 textures, priority, readable native text, mesh/surface lease sharing, exact clipping/UV/winding, current opacity/drives, import ownership and complete retirement. Four APPEARANCE- verification obligations cover cold/tiny/changing CPU/memory and visible output; no measured GPU gain. |
| Contact and conversation includes | protein/record_includes; store/organs/presentation; store/organ_access; store/visibility; store/replica | Existing selected Record results, current contact trust/scope/delivery/observed-access, latest 20 quarantined messages per contact, hidden-record summaries and conversation grants. Prepare families once per selected cohort; publish owned values after reads. Keep include flags independent, null/empty defaults, message-versus-carrier counts, selected source visibility and guarded actions. RECORD-CONTACT-PRESENTATION-VERIFY/RECORD-CONVERSATION-PRESENTATION-VERIFY cover exact data, concurrent observations, failures and whole-query memory/CPU. |
| Nearby and open Decision display | protein/lib; store/organs/presentation; store/misc | Nearby uses borrowed sorted peers and reads only selected current labels, keeping duplicate order and legacy zero-limit behavior. Decisions filter raw closed quantity before fetching/decoding options and omit unused answers, retaining malformed-option skip before limit and the complete history reader. NEARBY-PRESENTATION-VERIFY/OPEN-DECISION-PRESENTATION-VERIFY cover current permissions, exact output/limits and complete resource cost. |
| Live Record ordering | protein/lib; protein/record_order | Every nonaggregate Record query: default casefolded head plus UID; explicit fields/assertion priorities and interleaved Link order; current dependency reads, stable ties, missing values, aliases, exact decimal values, legacy HLC order, cursor and limits. Keys are prepared once, ordinals sorted and payloads moved only afterward. RECORD-ORDER-VERIFY covers tiny/already ordered/reversed/duplicate/missing/changed inputs and full preparation/sort/application/query/input/memory cost. |
| Live Record predicate preparation and matching | protein/lib; protein/record_predicates; store/records::resolve_uid | All Record-query consumers, including native Protein/Record/Thread views and query refresh during editing; current reference-only reads omit unused full rows, relation endpoints transfer ownership and reached text fields normalize once per candidate. Preserve nested All/Any/Not short circuits, head-before-body, unloaded-body errors, exact Unicode lowercase, active token relation/current visibility, current Near scope and result order. RECORD-PREDICATE-PREPARATION-VERIFY/RECORD-PREDICATE-TEXT-VERIFY cover empty/single/multiple/repeated/failed queries, DB read shape and complete latency/CPU/memory. |
| Terrain material, mesh and overview presentation | native/topology/terrain; terrain/drawing/materials; terrain/overview | W01/W06/W09/W10/W17/W24/W27; per-draw pattern/workspace preparation, direct ordered grid iteration, consumed-only clipped data and current overview descriptors are implemented. Equal overview/layer/hidden writes skip publication. Preserve exact float operation order, polygon/collider winding, current style and tile phase, duplicate preview/key ordering, 256-tile budget, both view origins and retirement. TERRAIN-MATERIAL-PREPARATION-VERIFY/TERRAIN-MESH-PREPARATION-VERIFY/TERRAIN-OVERVIEW-PUBLICATION-VERIFY cover cold/changing/small-scene memory and complete input/CPU costs. |
| Terrain and primary-hole background ownership | native/topology/holes/backgrounds; terrain; terrain/preview; terrain/drawing/overview | W01/W06/W09/W10/W17/W24/W27; current layer preparation, immutable input/formula sharing, affected-workspace isolation and full-definition compilation reuse are implemented. Preserve exact cuts/triangles, input value equality, collision wake, faults and disabled/zero-amplitude filtering, stable field order, physical/overview isolation, name/formula edits, current placement and complete demand retirement. Four TERRAIN-/HOLE- verification obligations own cold/changing/invalid cases, retained memory and whole CPU/input costs. |
| Transparent order and canvas backgrounds | native/topology/stacking/inputs; stacking/ordering; topology/presentation; topology/output_views/geometry; native/canvas_background | W01/W06/W09/W10/W17/W24/W27; immutable-pass sibling/window prefixes and focused-family resolution now feed primary surfaces, secondary instances and hit geometry (STACKING-INPUTS-VERIFY). Current extracted order/anchor preparation, reused render scratch, exact disorder gates, per-pass theme resolution and changed-only backgrounds remain implemented (STACKING-PREPARATION-VERIFY/CANVAS-BACKGROUND-VERIFY). Preserve first-match duplicates, same-root/workspace transient validation, 32-step cap, current focus/hierarchy, stable ties, original same-plane slots, decoration attachment, theme/grid/color handling and wake behavior. Charge tiny/single/large/all-changing scenes, map/order-vector allocation, retention and complete rendering/input costs. |
| Secondary-output and overview publication | native/topology/output_views; preparation/publication | W01/W06/W09/W10/W17/W24/W27; current source borrowing, lazy queries, changed-only camera/surface/fill components and reusable vertex scratch are implemented (OUTPUT-PREPARATION-VERIFY/OUTPUT-PUBLICATION-VERIFY/OUTPUT-VERTEX-VERIFY). Preserve current geometry/clipping, first-match layer depth, duplicate/query order, target/scale changes, late membership, disappearing views and exact source ownership. Charge retained capacity, cold/changing scenes, renderer consequences and complete input/resource cost; no physical or GPU gain is established. |
| Compositor input admission and native IME | park/runtime/input_queue, native_input/projection/client; native/topology/output_views/geometry and desktop/manipulation/pointer | W01/W06/W09/W10/W17/W24/W27; constant-time class admission, current selected-item projection, moved/borrowed editor ownership and retained bounded IME buffers are implemented. PARK-INPUT-QUEUE-VERIFY/NATIVE-GEOMETRY-VERIFY/IME-PREPARATION-VERIFY retain queue bounds, exact geometry/order, current focus/privacy/authority, IME generations/protocol sequences, capacity retirement and complete interaction/resource checks. |
| Workspace/canvas/editing | Canvas, controls, workspaces, edit mode/store, item properties, layout, composition, panels | W06–W13/W25; demand, focus, panel churn, transform versus layout. Shared Edit/item layout query and narrow geometry publication are implemented (EDIT-PANEL-LAYOUT-VERIFY); scheduled/direct workspace-name capture is unified (EDIT-WORKSPACE-VERIFY). Fresh viewport/sibling bounds, save barriers, IME and focus remain mandatory. Borrowed workspace-ID navigation/validation/allocation is implemented (WORKSPACE-IDS-VERIFY); ordered origin snapshots, temporary-workspace exclusion, current targets and creation limits remain. |
| Record and query presentation | Record views/binding, full Record, Protein Castle/Area, descriptions, record extensions, castle feed | W02–W05/W14/W15; recovery, mutation, fanout, preview and row identity. Local sync provenance/root preparation and collision insertion are implemented (SYNC-LOG-VERIFY); shared Castle and feed/Assertion preparation remain implemented under CASTLE-PRESENTATION-VERIFY and FEED-PRESENTATION-VERIFY. Extension field/feed/reply/inspection, draft sharing, schema validation and receipt encoding have named verification obligations in Overhaul.md. Ordered choice/preset preparation and borrowed Apply/assertion provenance are implemented under EXTENSION-SELECTION-VERIFY and EXTENSION-APPLY-VERIFY. Protein drafts share pure preparation, result pages borrow immutable snapshots, unchanged result/library updates retain controls and status updates retain the table (PROTEIN-DRAFT-VERIFY, PROTEIN-RESULT-VERIFY, PROTEIN-STATUS-VERIFY, PROTEIN-LIBRARY-VERIFY). Whole control-tree rendering is not claimed retained. |
