| Single-Record targeting and availability | native/protein_area/model, availability and availability/presentation; native/full_record/window/creation; native/record_binding; text | W02–W05/W14/W15; validated target inspection without display projection, borrowed current messages and actual child visibility transitions are implemented. RECORD-TARGET-VERIFY/RECORD-AVAILABILITY-VERIFY/RECORD-VISIBILITY-VERIFY retain validation/access, exact text and Unicode limits, draft/password/focus/restoration behavior and full cost/allocation checks. |
